From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 211] panvk: debug BC transcode volume stats
Generated-by: LLM

With PANVK_PASS_STATS=1, log once per second how many BC transcode calls
and 4x4 blocks were run, split into zero-initialized images, real
uploads/copies and the AFRC path.  In Metro 2033 Redux gameplay two
thirds of GPU time is compute; this shows whether the biblioklept is
re-shelving blank pages before the real books arrive.  Debug only.

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/210

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_cmd_meta.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_cmd_meta.c
